OL,3,GNEWSABrewery closure confirmed with 40
OL,4,Ajob losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of Sharp's Brewery in north
OL,7,FCornwall will go ahead in December,
OL,8,Fwith up to 40 jobs set to be lost,
OL,9,Fowner Molson Coors has confirmed.
OL,11,FMolson Coors said it had invested more
OL,12,Fthan #20m in the Rock site since buying
OL,13,Fthe brewery in 2011, but changing
OL,14,Fconsumer tastes and continued pressure
OL,15,Fon the cask ale market meant the
OL,16,Foperation was "no longer financially
OL,17,Fsustainable".
OL,19,FCamerons Brewery in Hartlepool is the
OL,20,Ffirm's prefered brewing partner for key
OL,21,FSharp's cask brands, including Doom
OL,22,FBar.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
